{
    "chapter_num": 8,
    "verses_count": 24,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Excel in Giving"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover, brethren, we make known to you the grace of God bestowed on the churches of Macedonia: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that in a great trial of affliction the abundance of their joy and their deep poverty abounded in the riches of their liberality. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I bear witness that according to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ability, yes, and beyond "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ability, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " freely willing, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "imploring us with much urgency "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit that we would receive, thus changing text to urgency for the favor and fellowship"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that we would receive the gift and the fellowship of the ministering to the saints. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "only"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as we had hoped, but they first gave themselves to the Lord, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "then"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to us by the will of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So we urged Titus, that as he had begun, so he would also complete this grace in you as well. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But as you abound in everything—in faith, in speech, in knowledge, in all diligence, and in your love for us—"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "see"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that you abound in this grace also."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christ Our Pattern"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I speak not by commandment, but I am testing the sincerity of your love by the diligence of others. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you know the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ, that though He was rich, yet for your sakes He became poor, that you through His poverty might become rich."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And in this I give advice: It is to your advantage not only to be doing what you began and were desiring to do a year ago; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but now you also must complete the doing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of it;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a readiness to desire "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "may be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a completion out of what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " have. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if there is first a willing mind, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " accepted according to what one has, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not according to what he does not have."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mean"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that others should be eased and you burdened; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but by an equality, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " now at this time your abundance "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "may supply"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their lack, that their abundance also may "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "supply"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your lack—that there may be equality. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As it is written, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“He who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "gathered"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "much had nothing left over, and he who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "gathered"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "little had no lack.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Collection for the Judean Saints"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But thanks "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to God who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU has put"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "puts the same earnest care for you into the heart of Titus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he not only accepted the exhortation, but being more diligent, he went to you of his own accord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we have sent with him the brother whose praise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the gospel throughout all the churches, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and not only "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but who was also chosen by the churches to travel with us with this gift, which is administered by us to the glory of the Lord Himself and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to show"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your ready mind, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "avoiding this: that anyone should blame us in this lavish gift which is administered by us— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "providing honorable things, not only in the sight of the Lord, but also in the sight of men."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we have sent with them our brother whom we have often proved diligent in many things, but now much more diligent, because of the great confidence which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we have"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "anyone inquires"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " about Titus, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "he is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my partner and fellow worker concerning you. Or if our brethren "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are inquired about, they are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " messengers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. apostles, “sent ones”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the churches, the glory of Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore show to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and before the churches, the proof of your love and of our boasting on your behalf."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}